    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a Get ready to punch fruit like a pro in the wildest boxing game ever! \ud83c\udf49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, duck, and deliver knockout blows to flying pumpkins and watermelons hurled by zany wizards and chaotic drones. These aren\u2019t your average fruits\u2014they punch back with jabs, hooks, and sneaky uppercuts! \ud83e\udd4a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Watch out for explosive pumpkins and watermelons\u2014hit one, and you\u2019ll take a score penalty! Stay sharp or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Don\u2019t just tap\u2014use real strength! Weak hits won\u2019t count, so bring the power punch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf49 Challenge Yourself and Practice Your Boxing Skill in This High-Speed Fruit-Punching Frenzy! \ud83e\udd4a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strap on your headset and enter the ultimate fruity showdown\u2014where flying pumpkins and rogue watermelons come at you fast, launched by sneaky fruit wizards and relentless aerial attack drones! Dodge, slice, and try not to get splattered! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece of fruit punches like a pro\u2014throwing: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a Straight jabs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Left hooks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Right hooks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f The dreaded shovel hook </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you smash, the wilder it gets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the action turns completely bananas, only the quickest reflexes can keep up with the rhythm\u2026 like the legendary Thousand-Hand Guanyin on a fruit-fueled rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4c Can you keep up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gear up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just walk to the boxing gloves or use the left hand controller\u2019s thumbstick to move the gloves to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left-controller\u2019s grip button to equip your left glove. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the right-controller\u2019s grip button to equip your right glove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need help or access settings?\u00a0 Press the X button on your left-controller to bring help-menu up at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you play, the faster and wilder the attacks become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a Get ready to punch fruit like a pro in the wildest boxing game ever! \ud83c\udf49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, duck, and deliver knockout blows to flying pumpkins and watermelons hurled by zany wizards and chaotic drones. These aren\u2019t your average fruits\u2014they punch back with jabs, hooks, and sneaky uppercuts! \ud83e\udd4a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Watch out for explosive pumpkins and watermelons\u2014hit one, and you\u2019ll take a score penalty! Stay sharp or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaa Don\u2019t just tap\u2014use real strength! Weak hits won\u2019t count, so bring the power punch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf49 Challenge Yourself and Practice Your Boxing Skill in This High-Speed Fruit-Punching Frenzy! \ud83e\udd4a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strap on your headset and enter the ultimate fruity showdown\u2014where flying pumpkins and rogue watermelons come at you fast, launched by sneaky fruit wizards and relentless aerial attack drones! Dodge, slice, and try not to get splattered! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each piece of fruit punches like a pro\u2014throwing: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a Straight jabs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Left hooks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Right hooks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f The dreaded shovel hook </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you smash, the wilder it gets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the action turns completely bananas, only the quickest reflexes can keep up with the rhythm\u2026 like the legendary Thousand-Hand Guanyin on a fruit-fueled rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4c Can you keep up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gear up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just walk to the boxing gloves or use the left hand controller\u2019s thumbstick to move the gloves to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left-controller\u2019s grip button to equip your left glove. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the right-controller\u2019s grip button to equip your right glove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need help or access settings?\u00a0 Press the X button on your left-controller to bring help-menu up at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you play, the faster and wilder the attacks become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83e\udd4a Practice Your Boxing Skill in This High-Speed Fruit-Punching Frenzy! Dodge and smash flying pumpkins and watermelons launched by wizards and drones. Each fruit attacks with jabs, hooks, and shovel punches. The pace gets crazy\u2014only lightning reflexes can match the Thousand-Hand Guanyin! \ud83c\udf4c",
